@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# N26 logical continuation admission addendum
+
+This prospective composition changes only historical evidence/provenance and source closure. N26 science, original 36-case independent arithmetic proof, typed recovery classifier, matrix, success gates and budget interface remain the accepted c09 implementation. Original N25 INVALID is permanently INVALID. Only a separately root-reviewed VALID_LOGICAL_DEV_REJECTION over the immutable original18 plus valid successor prefix can enable N26: logical REJECT or whole-original-quad REJECT_NUMERIC_FUTILITY. Promotion, later validation rejection, original/continuation INVALID and status disagreement are forbidden; predecessor-review-v1 is never a fallback.
+
+The named predecessor-logical-review-v1 binds common evidence and its original input, independent continuation root terminal review, ff common reader bytes, unchanged original runtime and historical N25 proof, this addendum and the root composition protocol. The common record remains non-authorizing. Rebuild it with the unchanged bounded common.build, including the pure historical terminal reader and original source proof association; do not invoke a continuation CLI/current-HEAD historical validation, outcome/native replay or model. Original costs/unknowns are preserved, never retroactively certified.
+
+Both root release and every admission must compare already-read matching current journal/resource subsets through common.check_current_matching_events. The bridge settled_control_proofs call chain covers tensor admission, plan freeze, launch and per-cell budget checks. Root release creation must explicitly call the same current_matching hook using the normal runner's current journal/resource reads under its existing lock. No complete private ledger hash is pinned forever. Projection completeness is root-attested; root must collect after terminal independent review, with no unsettled/later matching reservation.
+
+N26 requires one newly metered 36-case tensor-only native proof under final composed source. The old N25/N23 proofs retain their original source and scope. No new GPU proof is performed by CPU preparation. Authority/capacity remain unresolved until actual postclosure arithmetic and separate finite root adoption; cumulative 100 GPU hours and protected32/12 hour reserves remain unchanged. No validation/formal launcher is added.
+
+All6f continuation modules and ff common module remain identical. The shared runner/worker union consists solely of accepted c09 insertions and original6f routes. Explicit reverse bytes distinguish c09 science,6f continuation and ff common history. No new action, classifier, cleanup or process primitive is introduced.
